00:59:10.410 --> 00:59:11.410
Govind Das: Right?

347
00:59:11.850 --> 00:59:17.350
Govind Das: So, what happens? The cultural bias is built from the childhood.

348
00:59:19.310 --> 00:59:22.039
Govind Das: It is made to be normal.

349
00:59:23.920 --> 00:59:30.759
Govind Das: Alright, if the sun is born, you celebrate If daughter is gone.

350
00:59:30.920 --> 00:59:43.419
Govind Das: You celebrate after a little time. You take some time, oh, right, what is it? This cultural bias connected to gender, this cultural bias connected to

351
00:59:43.960 --> 00:59:53.010
Govind Das: the… You know, the upper class, lower class, the cultural bias connected to food habits, right?

352
00:59:53.400 --> 01:00:01.279
Govind Das: Like, the… just because somebody does not drink They're not necessarily moralist.

