01:00:05.600 --> 01:00:19.350
Govind Das: That one quality does not make us define, oh, he's a spoiled person, right? But this cultural bias, what do they do? They're extremely strong in identifying people as criminals.

355
01:00:20.360 --> 01:00:21.500
Govind Das: Right.

356
01:00:21.740 --> 01:00:24.469
Govind Das: So, therefore, it is very important

357
01:00:26.770 --> 01:00:31.420
Govind Das: To deal with this cultural bias, In a way.

