364
01:01:02.440 --> 01:01:06.780
Govind Das: So what does it do? That bias creates a superiority complex.

365
01:01:08.080 --> 01:01:14.860
Govind Das: You know? And therefore, When something in the client's life feels obviously wrong or right.

366
01:01:16.010 --> 01:01:22.549
Govind Das: And cultural bias, one of the problems of cultural bias, it operates on the principle of right and wrong.

367
01:01:23.460 --> 01:01:30.309
