Dr. Karan Mittal: If I'm really intelligent, okay, and my IQ is probably higher compared to the client sitting in front of me, then the confirmation and the diagnostic bias will take over. Because I will feel clienti, client doesn't know anything, okay? My buddy has analyzed this.

